<title>USA: Equity Corp International sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Equity Corp International sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, Texas 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Corp International said Wednesday it had approved a three-for-two common stock split to be effected as a stock dividend.</p>
<p>Record date for the dividend is September 23.  The dividend will be distributed October 2.</p>
<p>The company said currently there are 12,789,507 common shares outstanding.</p>
